## Web renderer (future, design only)

Same DagProgress model, different display:

    1. Serialize DagProgress to JSON
    2. Stream via SSE (server-sent events) or WebSocket
    3. Browser renders with SVG/Canvas
    4. CSS animations for "Flowing" edge state
    5. Click nodes to expand OutputSummary

The key insight: because DagProgress derives Serialize, the web
renderer is just `serde_json::to_string(&progress)` piped to a
connection. No new data model needed.

